every 2 seconds:
    say "tick".
every minute:
    say "a minute".
every 100 milliseconds:
    say "fast".
every day at 9pm:
    say "evening".
every Monday at 9:30am:
    say "meeting".
every Friday at 17:00:
    say "weekend".
whenever score is over 100:
    say "level up".
when score is over 50, say "halfway".
whenever a key is pressed:
    say it.
